<title>USA: Intercargo names Galanski president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Intercargo names Galanski president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAUMBURG, Ill. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intercargo Corp said Wednesday it has named Stanley Galanski president and chief executive officer, succeeding James Zuhlke, who remains as chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Galanski previously served as president of New Hampshire Insurance Co, a subsidiary of American International Group Inc.  </p>
<p>Intercargo is a specialty insurance provider with operations in the United States, Hong Kong and Britain.</p>
<p>Intercargo shares were unchanged at 11-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
